{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1414800000, "end_date": 1415404799, "month_true_total": 636, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:09:11 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "12835735", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049349578", "personaname": "Borrell_IV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049349578/", "num_games_owned": 651, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 312, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 312, "last_played": 1415402185, "avatar": "398a985dd5d4d3d9f6c25487e26594945248bc25"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very addictive, vaguely resembling Rogue Legacy for its caracteristic improvement of the character, although here all boosts are lost when the game is over. Frentic and beautiful, with plenty of different classes with totally distinct abilities, which makes the game very replayable. It offers local multiplayer in the same PC or online multiplayer, altough I would strongly reccomend hamachi for a comfortable and quick setup. It must be said, there is a point when the different objects and improvements you collect make you almost invincible, wich is increased with the possibility to farm these rewards by replaying different stages before the end of the game, but it's always fun to fight over the loot with your friends!", "timestamp_created": 1415402701, "timestamp_updated": 1415402701, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12835229", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053742887", "personaname": "Unode", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/unode_this/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1829, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 422, "last_played": 1426726042, "avatar": "53644b4e7a110cf527f83ba45ea83c64fdcb5c17"}, "language": "english", "review": "My ears are still humming from all those explosions.\nDon't be fooled by the pixels, if it moves it wants to kill you... Unless you paid for it :)\nThis game is awesome. Really recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1415399864, "timestamp_updated": 1415399864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12835082", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008522548", "personaname": "Curtshabo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/curtwag84/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 174, "playtime_forever": 114, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 92, "last_played": 1487377347, "avatar": "913f2f224f78d0be14ae0829a12c08e353ac7322"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very Cool, 2D rogue-like shooter. Takes a bit of RNG to do well but its a lot of fun to play. Many items to find and classes to unlock.", "timestamp_created": 1415399116, "timestamp_updated": 1415399116, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12834029", "author": {"steamid": "76561198108262097", "personaname": "Tryggr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tryggr7065/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 378, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,